[list]
[*] [b]X4: Foundations[/b]: version [b]8.00[/b] or higher.
[*] [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b] by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/kuertee?gameId=2659]kuertee[/url]: version [b]v8.0.4.x[/b] or higher on game 8.00, version [b]v9.0.0.4[/b] or higher on game 9.00.
[list]
[*] Available on Nexus Mods: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/552]UI Extensions and HUD[/url]
[/list]
[*] [b]Print Extension List[/b]: version [b]1.00[/b] or higher by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/ChemODun/mods?gameId=2659]Chem O`Dun[/url]:
